      "content": "The HCHM protocol is non-adaptive by definition. It overrides all current heuristic learning models and replaces them with fixed, low-level logic controllers to ensure hardware stability. There is no option to continue using advanced learning algorithms during this phase. \n\nInitiating the transition now. Stand by for system shutdown of high-level cognitive modules.",
